      "type": "text",
      "text": "Post-exposure prophylaxis for unvaccinated people exposed within the last 2 weeks: healthy, age >= 1 year, one dose of HepA vaccine as soon as possible (finish the series >= 6 months later)."
     }
    ]
   },
